# The build context is the whole repository, because the server is four path
# packages and a route tree. What it does not need is everything that makes
# that repository large: the analyzer's cache, the design shots, and every
# build directory except the two web bundles the console and back-office
# images are made of.
#
# Written down because the alternative is a gigabyte uploaded to the daemon on
# every build, most of it artefacts of the last one.
.git
**/.dart_tool
**/build
!apps/console/build/web
!apps/admin/build/web
docs
brand
infra/dev/firebase-data
**/*.iml
.vscode
.claude
